  "Version": 1.0,
  "DisplayName": "Flare",
  "Description": "Flare integration for Google SecOps. Connects Flare's threat exposure findings with Google SecOps so security teams can ingest dark-web, credential, and exposure alerts into SOAR cases and remediate directly from playbooks. Optional auto-remediation syncs closed SOAR Flare cases back to Flare using a timestamp checkpoint (no Google service account). In case of any queries, please reach out to support.",
